-- Regulation W, 12 CFR 223.2: what is an "affiliate" of a member bank.
--
-- Target compiler: main (see NOTES.md).
--
-- The definition is recursive: prongs (a)(5) and (a)(10) speak of "an affiliate of the member
-- bank", prong (a)(11) of a "company described in paragraphs (a)(1) through (10)", and the
-- exclusion in (b)(1)(iii)(A) lets a subsidiary back in when an affiliate controls it directly.
-- As with control (regw-control.l4), this module takes the LEAST fixed point: it starts from no
-- affiliates, and a company is added only once the text makes it an affiliate given the companies
-- already added.  The exclusion is written with its negation pushed inward, so the affiliates
-- found so far are used only positively and the set can only grow.
-- The recursion ends because `affiliates from` calls itself only on the companies still
-- undecided, after at least one has been removed from that list.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `regw-nouns`
IMPORT `regw-control`

§ `Building the inquiry`

GIVEN
    s  IS A Structure
    r  IS A Readings
    pu IS A Purpose
GIVETH AN Inquiry
`inquiry about` MEANS Inquiry OF s, r, pu, `control relation` s, direct
    WHERE
        direct MEANS
            IF r's `direct control` EQUALS `Any control, including securities attributed from subsidiaries`
            THEN `control relation` s
            ELSE `direct control relation` s

§ `Looking things up in an inquiry`

GIVEN i IS AN Inquiry
GIVETH A STRING
`bank of` MEANS i's `structure`'s `the member bank`

GIVEN i IS AN Inquiry
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`names of` MEANS map (GIVEN q YIELD q's `name`) (i's `structure`'s `the parties`)

GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    a IS A STRING
    b IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
controls MEANS `has link` (i's `control`) a b

GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    a IS A STRING
    b IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`directly controls` MEANS `has link` (i's `direct control`) a b

-- 223.2(a)(2) with 223.3(f): the member bank is a company controlled by a company that controls
-- it, so on the literal words it is its own affiliate.  The reading in `readings` decides.
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`may be an affiliate at all` MEANS
       (NOT (p's `name` EQUALS `bank of` i))
    OR i's `readings`'s `self-affiliation` EQUALS `The member bank is its own affiliate on the literal words`

§ `223.2(a): the prongs`

-- (1) Parent companies. Any company that controls the member bank.
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(1)
`prong 1` MEANS controls i (p's `name`) (`bank of` i)

-- (2) Companies under common control by a parent company. Any company, including any subsidiary
-- of the member bank, that is controlled by a company that controls the member bank.
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(2)
`prong 2` MEANS
    any (GIVEN y YIELD `names a company` (i's `structure`) y AND controls i y (`bank of` i) AND controls i y (p's `name`)) (`names of` i)

-- (3) Companies under other common control. Any company ... controlled ... by or for the benefit
-- of shareholders who beneficially or otherwise control ... the member bank or any company that
-- controls the member bank.  One shareholder at a time (NOTES.md: a group of shareholders).
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(3)
`prong 3` MEANS
    any (GIVEN sh YIELD controls i sh (p's `name`) AND shareholderOfBankOrController sh) (`names of` i)
    WHERE
        shareholderOfBankOrController sh MEANS
               controls i sh (`bank of` i)
            OR any (GIVEN y YIELD controls i y (`bank of` i) AND controls i sh y) (`names of` i)

-- (4) Companies with interlocking directorates. Any company in which a majority of its directors,
-- trustees, or general partners (or individuals exercising similar functions) constitute a
-- majority of the persons holding any such office with the member bank or any company that
-- controls the member bank.  The reading in `readings` decides "or" (NOTES.md).
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(4)
`prong 4` MEANS
    IF i's `readings`'s `interlock` EQUALS `One board at a time: the member bank, or one controlling company`
    THEN any (GIVEN z YIELD `a majority of both` xs (directors z)) boards
    ELSE `a majority of both` xs pool
    WHERE
        directors c MEANS nub (map (GIVEN l YIELD l's `from`) (filter (GIVEN l YIELD l's `to` EQUALS c) (i's `structure`'s `offices`)))
        xs MEANS directors (p's `name`)
        boards MEANS `bank of` i FOLLOWED BY filter (GIVEN y YIELD controls i y (`bank of` i)) (`names of` i)
        pool MEANS nub (concat (map directors boards))

-- "a majority of its directors ... constitute a majority of the persons holding any such office":
-- the persons in both groups are more than half of the first group and more than half of the second.
GIVEN
    xs IS A LIST OF STRING
    zs IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a majority of both` MEANS
        count common TIMES 2 GREATER THAN count xs
    AND count common TIMES 2 GREATER THAN count zs
    WHERE
        common MEANS filter (GIVEN d YIELD elem d zs) xs

-- (5) Sponsored and advised companies. Any company, including a real estate investment trust,
-- that is sponsored and advised on a contractual basis by the member bank or an affiliate of the
-- member bank.
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    p       IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(5)
`prong 5` MEANS
    any (GIVEN l YIELD l's `to` EQUALS p's `name` AND (l's `from` EQUALS `bank of` i OR elem (l's `from`) current)) (i's `structure`'s `sponsorships`)

-- (7) Depository institution subsidiaries. A depository institution that is a subsidiary of the
-- member bank.
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(7)
`prong 7` MEANS p's `is a depository institution` AND controls i (`bank of` i) (p's `name`)

-- (8) Financial subsidiaries. A financial subsidiary of the member bank.
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(8)
`prong 8` MEANS p's `is a financial subsidiary` AND controls i (`bank of` i) (p's `name`)

-- (10) Partnerships associated with the member bank or an affiliate. Any partnership for which
-- the member bank or any affiliate of the member bank serves as a general partner or for which
-- the member bank or any affiliate ... causes any director, officer, or employee ... to serve as
-- a general partner.
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    p       IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(10)
`prong 10` MEANS
        p's `kind` EQUALS Partnership
    AND any (GIVEN l YIELD l's `to` EQUALS p's `name` AND (l's `from` EQUALS `bank of` i OR elem (l's `from`) current)) (i's `structure`'s `general partners`)

-- A company "described in paragraphs (a)(1) through (10)", which is what prong (11) speaks of.
-- It is not the same as an affiliate: the exclusions in (b) have not been applied to it.
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    p       IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(11)
`described in prongs 1 to 10` MEANS
        `is a company` (i's `structure`) p
    AND `may be an affiliate at all` i p
    AND (   `prong 1` i p
         OR `prong 2` i p
         OR `prong 3` i p
         OR `prong 4` i p
         OR `prong 5` i current p
         OR `prong 7` i p
         OR `prong 8` i p
         OR `prong 10` i current p)

-- (11) Subsidiaries of affiliates. Any subsidiary of a company described in paragraphs (a)(1)
-- through (10).  The reading in `readings` decides whether a subsidiary of a company that is an
-- affiliate only through this prong counts (NOTES.md).
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    p       IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(11)
`prong 11` MEANS
    any (GIVEN z YIELD controls i (z's `name`) (p's `name`) AND parentCounts z) (i's `structure`'s `the parties`)
    WHERE
        parentCounts z MEANS
               `described in prongs 1 to 10` i current z
            OR (    i's `readings`'s `prong 11` EQUALS `A subsidiary of any affiliate, so that the prong chains`
                AND elem (z's `name`) current)

-- (12) Other companies. Any company that the Board determines by regulation or order, or that the
-- appropriate Federal banking agency determines by order, to have a relationship with the member
-- bank ... to the detriment of the member bank.  A determination is stated, not computed.
GIVEN
    i IS AN Inquiry
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)(12)
`prong 12` MEANS elem (p's `name`) (i's `structure`'s `determined affiliates`)

§ `223.2(b) and (c): what an affiliate does not include`

-- (b)(1) Subsidiaries. Any company that is a subsidiary of the member bank, unless the company is
-- (i) a depository institution; (ii) a financial subsidiary; (iii) directly controlled by (A) one
-- or more affiliates (other than depository institution affiliates) of the member bank, or (B) a
-- shareholder that controls the member bank [or a group of shareholders that together control it:
-- not encoded, NOTES.md]; (iv) an employee stock option plan, trust, or similar organization;
-- or (v) any other company determined to be an affiliate under paragraph (a)(12).
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    p       IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(b)(1)
`is an excluded subsidiary` MEANS
        controls i (`bank of` i) (p's `name`)
    AND NOT (   p's `is a depository institution`
             OR p's `is a financial subsidiary`
             OR directlyControlledByAffiliate
             OR directlyControlledByShareholder
             OR p's `is an employee benefit organization`
             OR `prong 12` i p)
    WHERE
        directlyControlledByAffiliate MEANS
            any (GIVEN y YIELD elem (y's `name`) current AND (NOT (y's `is a depository institution`)) AND `directly controls` i (y's `name`) (p's `name`)) (i's `structure`'s `the parties`)
        directlyControlledByShareholder MEANS
            any (GIVEN sh YIELD controls i sh (`bank of` i) AND `directly controls` i sh (p's `name`)) (`names of` i)

-- (b)(2) to (4): a company engaged solely in holding the premises of the member bank, in a safe
-- deposit business, or in holding obligations of the United States or its agencies.
-- (b)(5): a company where control results from rights arising out of a bona fide debt previously
-- contracted, for the period the text allows (stated, not computed).
-- (c): for subpart F (section 23B), a depository institution is not an affiliate.
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    p       IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(b)
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(c)
`is excluded` MEANS
        `is an excluded subsidiary` i current p
    OR (NOT (p's `sole activity` EQUALS `Some other activity`))
    OR p's `debt control` EQUALS `Held through a debt previously contracted, within the authorized period`
    OR (i's `purpose` EQUALS `Subpart F, section 23B` AND p's `is a depository institution`)

§ `The affiliates of a member bank`

-- One step: does 223.2 make `p` an affiliate, given the affiliates found so far?
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    p       IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.2(a)
`affiliate step` MEANS
        `is a company` (i's `structure`) p
    AND `may be an affiliate at all` i p
    AND (   `described in prongs 1 to 10` i current p
         OR `prong 11` i current p
         OR `prong 12` i p)
    AND NOT (`is excluded` i current p)

-- The least fixed point.  `current` holds the names found; `pending` the companies not yet found.
GIVEN
    i       IS AN Inquiry
    current IS A LIST OF STRING
    pending IS A LIST OF Party
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`affiliates from` MEANS
    LET found MEANS partition (GIVEN q YIELD `affiliate step` i current q) pending
    IN IF null (fst found)
       THEN current
       ELSE `affiliates from` i (append current (map (GIVEN q YIELD q's `name`) (fst found))) (snd found)

-- The names of the affiliates of the member bank.
GIVEN
    s  IS A Structure
    r  IS A Readings
    pu IS A Purpose
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`affiliates of the member bank` MEANS
    `affiliates from` (`inquiry about` s r pu) EMPTY (filter (GIVEN q YIELD `is a company` s q) (s's `the parties`))

GIVEN
    s    IS A Structure
    r    IS A Readings
    pu   IS A Purpose
    name IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is an affiliate` MEANS elem name (`affiliates of the member bank` s r pu)
